title: stage1_BestResponse
position: 424,526
---
Old Khaled: ..*smiles more*..
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
Old Khaled: ..How is your day young one?
<<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 10>> 
<<set $lightAdded = 10>>
    -> "It is blessed, Alhamdulilah"
        <<gesture nod>>
        <<jump stage1_nestedBestResponse>>
    -> "It was Rough, lots of things to do and no time to finish anything"
        <<gesture shrug>>
        <<jump stage1_nestedGoodResponse>> 
    -> "That is none of your business old man"
        <<gesture dismiss>>
        Old Khaled: ..how disappointing...
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
        Old Khaled: ...you should not listen to the voices in your head.
        Old Khaled: ..they will only destroy you, and their path only misleads.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled cocky>>
        Old Khaled: ..like how the moths mistake their doom for their salvation.
        Old Khaled: only when it is too late, that they realise what they have done.
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship -= 20>>
        <<set $lightAdded = -5>>
        -> "I am sorry, it won't happen again"
            <<gesture lookAway>>
            Old Khaled: ..the higher your light the easier it gets..
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
            Old Khaled: ..the lower...the weaker you will get
            Old Khaled: ..and the easier you will be deceived.
            <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 3>>
            <<jump GoodResponseParameters>>
        -> "I am not a moth old man, I know what i am doing"
            <<gesture angry>>
            Old Khaled: ..how unfortunate..
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
            Old Khaled: ..you are walking right into their trap.
            <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 3>>
            <<jump WorstResponseParameters>>
        -> "If i don't act tough, people will deceive me with good words"
            <<gesture shrug>>
            Old Khaled: ..you are deceiving yourself..
            <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
            Old Khaled: ...you don't need to be tough to avoid being deceived
            Old Khaled: ....you only need to be smart..and look behind the words
            Old Khaled: ..where do they lead? and what are the motives behind them?
            Old Khaled: are they truly your words? or someone else's?
            <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 3>>
            <<jump NeutralResponseParameters>>
===

title: stage1_nestedBestResponse
position: 761,716
---
Old Khaled: Alhamdulilah, care to join an old man for some tea?
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
<<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 10>> 
<<set $lightAdded = 15>>
    -> "I am sorry, but I got things to do at the moment, but thanks for the invite"
        <<gesture nod>>
        Old Khaled: It is ok young one, finish your todos and come by.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
        Old Khaled: Don't be late, I sleep early..*smiles*
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump GoodResponseParameters>>
    -> "Thank you very much for the invite, but i don't want to bother you any further"
        <<gesture wave>>
        Old Khaled: young man, your manners keep surprising me.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
        Old Khaled: what a bright lad you are.
        Old Khaled: don't let others influence your good manners.
        Old Khaled: it is truly a light to be cherished.
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 20>> 
        <<set $lightAdded = 20>>
        <<jump stage1_conclusion>>
    -> "Thank you, but tea isn't really my favorite"
        <<gesture shrug>>
        Old Khaled: ..you know tea was once the drink that i used to refuse.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled cocky>>
        Old Khaled: ..until i learned.
        Old Khaled: ..that it is not the drink's fault, but the people you drink it with.
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump NeutralResponseParameters>>
    -> "Tea? ..who drinks tea these days"
        <<gesture sarcastic>>
        Old Khaled: ...the worst thing you could say was no.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled dismiss>>
        Old Khaled: ...now if you excuse me.
        Old Khaled: ..it is about time for my morning nap.
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump BadResponseParameters>>
