title: stage1_nestedGoodResponse
position: 166,650
---
Old Khaled: life can be quite distracting.
Old Khaled: but only those with true light will see beyond the noise.
<<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled nod>>
Old Khaled: Don't let that bother you young one, one day all of this will pass.
Old Khaled: and you will remember it and then laugh..*smiles faintly*
<<set $Shiekh_Khaled_relationship += 10>> 
    -> "Beyond the noise? what does that mean"
        <<gesture shrug>>
        Old Khaled: you will know when you see.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
        Old Khaled: *smiles*
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump GoodResponseParameters>>
    -> "Noise is something you hear not see, you know that right?"
        <<gesture sarcastic>>
        Old Khaled: ..how disappointing..
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled deny>>
        Old Khaled: ..sometimes words mislead who hears it...
        Old Khaled: but guides who listens to it...
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump BadResponseParameters>>
    -> "I think you missed your meds morning slot"
        <<gesture cocky>>
        Old Khaled: ..hmm?.. but i do remember taking them...
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled angry>>
        Old Khaled: ..wait.. hey!..you need to pick your words more carefully with your elders.
        Old Khaled: words can hurt more than a sword.
        Old Khaled: and the older you grow that slower you will heal, until your wounds never stop bleeding.
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump WorstResponseParameters>>
    -> "What lies behind the noise?"
        <<gesture nod>>
        Old Khaled: ..if i give you that answer now, you will lose it later.
        <<npc_gesture Shiekh_Khaled wave>>
        Old Khaled: ....if i make it tell tomorrow maybe then you will know.
        Old Khaled: *faint laugh*
        <<set $Shiekh_Khaled_progress = 2>>
        <<jump BestResponseParameters>>
